# What Cloudflare Pages must NOT publish.
#
# `wrangler pages deploy .` uploads the working directory, which is the whole
# repository. Verified against production before this file existed:
#   /scripts/db-query.mjs            200
#   /scripts/probe-apps.mjs          200   <- carries the demo password as a default
#   /supabase/migrations/0112_apps.sql  200   <- every table, policy and function
# No access token was ever in any of them (db-query reads one from a path outside
# the repo), but the entire database schema and a working set of demo credentials
# were downloadable by anybody who guessed a filename.
#
# Only what a browser actually loads should be here. Everything below is either
# tooling, history, or a mockup.

scripts
supabase
shots
node_modules
.git
.github
.claude
docs
*.md
*.sql
*.log
.assetsignore
